  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Diaspora Engagement and its Contribution to the National Development Plan in Somalia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project will provide communications tools and a policy framework for the Government of Somalia to effectively and strategically engage with and forge a stronger partnership with the Somali diaspora by strategically engaging with diaspora as a key development actor and to align diaspora engagement to national and global frameworks, ensuring policy coherence and integrated migration governance. The project will include strategic communications toolkits for Somali diplomats/ambassadors, the connectors between the Ministry of Federal Affairs and the diaspora communities and female-focused analysis on female diaspora&apos;s contribution to development in Somalia.</narrative>
  </description>
